        <headline>Special Weather Statement issued September 24 at 8:10AM MDT by NWS Cheyenne WY</headline>
        <description>Patchy areas of dense fog...with visibilities at or below one-
quarter of a mile, will persist until 9 AM this morning,
especially along Interstate 80 near Kimball.

If you are driving, especially along I-80 near Kimball and in
Kimball County, please watch for patchy dense fog.

If you encounter dense fog, please slow down, use your low beam
headlights and allow for some extra travel time to safely reach
your destination.
</description>
